I don't have any general advice for prior choice unfortunately, as it can be very problem specific; consider the likely scale of the effect, and set the std.dev <http://std.dev>. prior accordingly. I think the PC-prior paper may discuss that. Also see the Matern PC-prior paper, at https://arxiv.org/pdf/1503.00256.pdf

Finn

